      {
        "id": 4506,
        "name": "Madden NFL 95",
        "summary": "Play exhibition, Super Bowl, playoffs or full season with any of the 1994 teams or all Madden teams.\n\nThis time around, you can select whether or not to include weather conditions, new player animations (high steppin', QB slides), a bigger field and over 100 injuries.\n\nAlso includes windowless passing, all new Madden-designed strategies and team match-up that shows how your players stack up to the other team in their position.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co4lb5.jpg",
