        "id": 45679,
        "name": "Clan of Heroes: Generals of the Yang Family",
        "summary": "Clan of Warriors - Generals of the Yang Family is a beat'em up that is based off the story several old Chinese stories and Folklore Songs.\n\nChoose between 4 playable warriors to defend your country from foreign military invaders.\n\nThis title was originally released exclusively in China. Piko Interactive acquired the full rights of the game to localize it to English speaking players. The game has been completely re-hauled fixing many of the original bugs and play ability problems. There is a lot of polishing done to the fighting and collision engine. Over all the game was worked up to be finally enjoyable from beginning to end.",
