        "cached_at": 1772526003
      },
      {
        "id": 215157,
        "name": "Sonic 1: South Island Expedition",
        "summary": "Sonic 1: South Island Definitive is a hack by RadiantNexus Team, which seeks to reimagine Sonic 1 by rearranging levels. remixing music, adding features from future games, and readding scrapped ideas in new and interesting ways.\n\nMajor features:\n\n3 acts of reimagined level design, including one act that has yet to be fully reimagined in any other hack.\nA miniboss.\nMassive art overhaul all over the place.\nMusic made by ProjectFM and MechaKnuckles.\nMenus!\nA custom splash screen.\nThere's been massive engine overhauls as well, including the Sonic 3 level layout format for massive levels, and the Sonic 3 object manager to go alongside this.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co92c3.jpg",
        "release_date": null,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "29",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sonic-1-south-island-expedition",
        "cached_at": 1772526003
      },
      {
        "id": 215379,
        "name": "30 Years of Nintendon't",
        "summary": "In 1988, SEGA released the Megadrive home console in Japan. In 1989, the machine was released in the USA under the name Sega Genesis. To convince players that the 16-bit Megadrive / Genesis was better than the then-ageing Nintendo NES console, Sega created ads with a brilliant headline: \"Genesis does what Nintendon't\". \"30 Years of Nintendon't\" is a tribute to the Megadrive / Genesis console and this wonderful marketing campaign.\n\nAs a Sega evangelist, you'll have to convince players to leave their NES console and avoid the SNES because \"Genesis does what Nintendon't\". How much market share can you earn thanks to your knowledge of the Megadrive / Genesis games library?",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co55zh.jpg",
        "release_date": 1546214400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": null,
