        "summary": "Insector X is a horizontally scrolling shooter.\n\nThe Genesis version has a number of differences: \"realistic\" sprite work (compared to the \"cute\" style of the original), brand new music, a reworking of the secondary weapon system, the removal of the autofire powerup, and new stage sections, among other things. Hot-B's original design for the game was better realized on the Genesis, as Taito requested a more comical style of game for the original release.",
